		{"id":"1a4b233295b53e19","type":"text","text":"# Opportunities\n\n- Galois research engineer/intern\n- Voltaris (stealth)\n\t- [Software Engineer](https://voltaris.notion.site/software-engineer-stealth)\n\t- [Machine Learning Research Scientist — Physics (Stealth)](https://voltaris.notion.site/machine-learning-research-scientist-physics-stealth)\n\t- [ML Research scientist](https://voltaris.notion.site/machine-learning-research-scientist-protein-modeling-stealth)\n- [Tatta Bio](https://github.com/TattaBio)\n- [CoherenceNeuro](https://www.opto.bio/careers#career)\n- [ConvokeBio](https://www.convoke.bio/about#section-4-jobs)\n- [Software Engineer, Trusted Computing and Cryptography \\| OpenAI](https://openai.com/careers/software-engineer-trusted-computing-and-cryptography/): I have worked with this technology, and I'm comfortable I can work here.\n- [Careers - PTI - Parallel Squared Technology Institute](https://www.parallelsq.org/careers)\n- [Tahoe Therapeutics - Senior Machine Learning Scientist](https://jobs.lever.co/tahoebio-ai/e9e3bab4-db92-415f-a2ed-f58c30362adf)\n\t- [Tahoe Therapeutics - Senior Software Engineer - Bioinformatics](https://jobs.lever.co/tahoebio-ai/6b7a6a22-a533-4c63-beb8-188eec685695)\n- [AI Research Engineer @ Chai Discovery](https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/chaidiscovery/64fcb54e-d008-4551-858a-5c0f3b48f270)\n- [Applied AI/Bio Scientist, Biologics @ Chai Discovery](https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/chaidiscovery/5e233eb8-7174-4844-b24d-6b5873269e62)\n- [Job Application for Applied Research Engineer, Motion Planning at Intrinsic](https://job-boards.greenhouse.io/intrinsicrobotics/jobs/5623121004?gh_jid=5623121004): masters in CS or Robotics, python, c++, ML (graph nets, deep learning, transformer), physical simulations (mujoco, gazebo, issac-sim), motion planning for robotics \n- [AI Scientist  @ VantAI](https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/vantai/b6e64420-4055-42c7-8a87-b9648a906203)\n- [https://x.com/JannikGrothusen](https://x.com/JannikGrothusen)\n\t- [The Robot Learning Company: TRLC-DK1](https://www.robot-learning.co/)\n\t  reach out to this person somehow. he's doing cool stuff with robotics. and that's too open-source.\n- [Job Application for Research Associate, Drug Discovery at General Proximity](https://job-boards.greenhouse.io/generalproximity/jobs/5660523004): All they hire are PhDs and require a ton on wet-lab experience for a research associate role man. Wow.\n- [Job Application for Machine Learning Scientist, Interatomic Potentials at Lila Sciences](https://job-boards.greenhouse.io/lilasciences/jobs/4031425009)\n- [ML Engineer​](https://jobs.lever.co/RadicalAI/078f84f2-0e62-4d51-8d2f-ce898ef9ea6e)\n- [Research Associate II, Protein Analytics](https://job-boards.greenhouse.io/twistbioscience/jobs/7178194)\n- [ML Engineer (Internship and Full-time) @ Tilde](https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/tilde/b2e145db-0111-47c1-9d9f-e856a057d8ef)\n---\n\n","x":-2267,"y":1680,"width":1379,"height":780},
